{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2023-01-31 21:51:00', 'title': 'LUV NOTICE: ROSEN, THE FIRST FILING FIRM, ENCOURAGES SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. INVESTORS TO SECURE COUNSEL BEFORE IMPORTANT DEADLINE IN SECURITIES CLASS ACTION COMMENCED BY THE FIRM - LUV', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - JANUARY 31, 2023) - WHY:\xa0ROSEN LAW FIRM, A GLOBAL INVESTOR RIGHTS LAW FIRM, REMINDS PURCHASERS OF THE SECURITIES OF SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. (NYSE: LUV) BETWEEN JUNE 13, 2020 AND DECEMBER 31, 2022, BOTH DATES INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD"), OF THE IMPORTANT MARCH 13, 2023 LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE IN THE SECURITIES CLASS ACTION COMMENCED BY THE FIRM.'}{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2023-01-31 18:25:00', 'title': 'SOUTHWEST CLASS ACTION: LEVI & KORSINSKY REMINDS SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. INVESTORS OF THE PENDING CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT WITH A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF MARCH 13, 2023 - LUV', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - JANUARY 31, 2023) - LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. ("SOUTHWEST" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: LUV) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT.THE LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF SOUTHWEST INVESTORS HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE SOUTHERN DISTRICT OF TEXAS. AFFECTED INVESTORS PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED CERTAIN SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. SECURITIES BETWEEN JUNE 13, 2020 AND DECEMBER 31, 2022.'}{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2023-01-31 05:45:00', 'title': 'LUV ALERT: THE KLEIN LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF MARCH 13, 2023 IN THE CLASS ACTION FILED ON BEHALF OF SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. SHAREHOLDERS', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JAN. 31, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE KLEIN LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES THAT A CLASS ACTION COMPLAINT HAS BEEN FILED ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. (NYSE: LUV) ALLEGING THAT THE COMPANY VIOLATED FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS. CLASS PERIOD: JUNE 13, 2020 TO DECEMBER 31, 2022 LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE: MARCH 13, 2023 NO OBLIGATION OR COST TO YOU.'}